# AI detection

Keep stages separate: observation → detection → event → verification → incident → alert → action (`docs/AI-PIPELINE.md`).

Every observation needs confidence, model version, camera/zone IDs, timestamps, and geometry.

Do not treat a model output as a confirmed incident without threshold + persistence/de-dupe + HITL or an explicit audited policy.

Label synthetic frames `[MOCK / SYNTHETIC]`.
